# All in the Cards (jeuno 166), GM-set Date exactly now (charvar 1800000000, the harness's constant wall clock:
# GetSystemTime() == Date), Collect Tarut Cards and Rubbish Day completed (Rubbish Day's Event 199 stays at Chululu).
# Each of the quest's three time checks is false at equality (Lua >): available, no 10110 (Rubbish Day's 199 alone);
# accepted (GM addQuest), 10111 and not 10112 (first in the cycle with 199: the single-action trigger before wrote no
# cycle var); completed (GM completeQuest, Date kept), no 10113 (199 alone).
lists LowerJeuno/Chululu/onTrigger
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-9,-6.7,-42.5 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Jeuno.CollectTarutCards completed
quest Jeuno.RubbishDay completed
charvar Quest[3][166]Date 1800000000
login
trigger Chululu                             # available, GetSystemTime() == Date: no section; Rubbish Day's 199
finish
quest Jeuno.AllInTheCards accepted
trigger Chululu                             # accepted, GetSystemTime() == Date: 10111, not 10112
finish
quest Jeuno.AllInTheCards completed
trigger Chululu                             # completed, GetSystemTime() == Date: no section; Rubbish Day's 199, not 10113
finish
